    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d290">

                <pb facs="0337" n="303" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg303"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Sherman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-09-24"><hi rendition="#italic">September 24,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Have visited foreign office to urge early date for Bering Sea conference. Promise
                    reply. Have expressed my disagreement with conclusion of British Government
                    about Russia and Japan, and await your further instructions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
